       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Just further down here and you will be back in \\c[3]Autumn's Rise\\c[0]!",
       "transl": "Noch etwas weiter hier runter und ihr seid zurück in \\c[3]Autumn's Rise\\c[0]!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "EXCITED"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Nice! I certainly don't miss being stuck in one place.",
       "transl": "Sehr gut! Ich bin nämlich nicht scharf darauf, wieder an einem Ort festzusitzen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "LAUGH"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Oh, and just so you are aware...",
       "transl": "Ach ja, nur dass ihr Bescheid wisst..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "NOTIFYING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "For now we have decided to limit access to Homestedt to selected players only.",
       "transl": "Wir haben beschlossen, vorerst nur ausgewählten Spielern Zugang zu Heimstatt zu gewähren."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "After all, this place is supposed to give you a bit of privacy.",
       "transl": "Schließlich soll dieser Ort euch ein bisschen Privatsphäre geben."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...?",
       "transl": "...?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Right.\\. I'd hate to wake up with dozens of random players squatting in my house.",
       "transl": "Ja.\\. Ich hab nämlich keine Lust, Morgens aufzuwachen und 'nen Haufen wildfremder Leute in meiner Bude zu haben."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ASTONISHED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[киває]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Exactly.",
       "transl": "Genau."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Now, one last thing!",
       "transl": "Gut, eine Sache noch!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "NOTIFYING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "You both get an access pass to the whole city of Rhombus Square!",
       "transl": "Ihr bekommt beide einen Zugangspass für gesamt Rhombus Square!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DOWN"
