       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "What exactly are we supposed to do now?",
       "transl": "Was genau sollen wir denn jetzt tun?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "NORM_SERIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well...\\. for now you simply can take your time to get used to your new life as Evotars.",
       "transl": "Nun ja...\\. Ihr solltet euch erst einmal die Zeit nehmen, um euch an euer neues Leben als Evotar zu gewöhnen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "THINKING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "That's fair...\\. but like...",
       "transl": "Ja, sicher...\\. aber..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "WONDERING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "What exactly is our point in being in this game?",
       "transl": "Was genau ist unser Sinn in diesem Spiel?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "SERIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I suppose there is new content that is left for us to play but once that is done?\n",
       "transl": "Es gibt neue Inhalte, die wir noch spielen können, ja, aber was ist, wenn das erledigt ist?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.luke",
       "expression": "PONDERING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well....",
       "transl": "Nun..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DOWN"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Let me just say that there are already plans about your future role in CrossWorlds.",
       "transl": "Ich kann dazu vorerst nur sagen, dass es bereits Pläne für eure zukünftige Rolle in CrossWorlds gibt."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey-av",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But I will have to get back to you about that soon.",
       "transl": "Ich werde aber bald nochmal auf dieses Thema zurückkommen."
